The files in this directory (india-*.geojson, india-zones.json) are a
Derived Database of OpenStreetMap data, built by Paperdrop Corp.

They are made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Attribution: "© OpenStreetMap contributors"
(https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright)

If you use these files in a map, credit OpenStreetMap contributors where the
map is shown. If you change the data and share it, share the changed data
under the ODbL too. The ODbL applies to the data only. The code in this
repository outside data/ is under the MIT licence (see ../LICENSE).

Two small parts of the Longju outline follow Natural Earth's India
point-of-view line, which is in the public domain.
